Task: Create IPC handler for Launch Agent in Terminal
Changes:
- Added terminalLaunchAgent channel to IPC_CHANNELS and TerminalApi.
- Implemented terminalLaunchAgent handler in src/main/terminal-ipc.ts.
- The handler loads plan details, parses them, finds the task, expands the agent command, and executes it in a new terminal session.
- Added unit tests for the new IPC handler.
Why: To bridge the UI request to launch an agent with the actual execution on the backend.
